{"title":"2012 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For a science project, Sammy observed a chipmunk and squirrel stashing acorns in holes. The chipmunk hid 3 acorns in each of the holes it dug. The squirrel hid 4 acorns in each of the holes it dug. They each hid the same number of acorns, although the squirrel needed 4 fewer holes. How many acorns did the chipmunk hide?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a4de86ae315f8a61128216d3d8a15535a159615.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 30\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 36\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 42\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 48\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 54$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is the number of holes that the chipmunk dug, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/e/4be7ccaf818a251c934cb215f4827566c2f7f3e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x=4(x-4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"107\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/5/8f555cbc43d4780da281075418071d204f45d253.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x=4x-16$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"103\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/2/1628581d2c8bdf5dfbb9d5fafe360ec1773aaff6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=16$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" />. The number of acorns hidden by the chipmunk is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/c/38ca0f5a0bc45e77eeb02374abf34defae4bcfa6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 48}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Trying answer choices, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/1/a310bc21c1c148d5b7b856f20b9f1b444b222987.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 48}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"66\" height=\"30\" /> works. ~Extremelysupercooldude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B\" title=\"2012 AMC 12B\">2012 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2012 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2012 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2012 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2012 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2012 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2012 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\"